{{- /* pi custom models — generated from llm.yaml (llm.tools.pi).
       Schema: @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/docs/models.md

       Secrets stay out of this file: apiKey uses pi's `!command` form to shell
       out to bin/pass-field at request time, the same helper codex's config
       uses. Nothing here is sensitive, so no private_ attribute.

       Merge semantics do the heavy lifting. For a provider pi already bundles
       (anthropic, openai), built-in models are kept and ours are upserted by
       id — so the bundled catalog's rich metadata survives while the IV proxy's
       extra ids (claude-opus-5, the -thinking variants) get added on top. */ -}}
{{- $providers := includeTemplate "llm/custom-providers" (merge (dict "tool" "pi") .) | fromJson -}}
{{ dict "providers" $providers | toPrettyJson }}
